# FINAL DESIGN EXPECTATION

Imagine that someone visits Angel for the first time.

They should feel that they have entered the outer environment of the same intelligent, living digital companion they will later experience inside the workspace.

The landing page introduces Angel's world.

The animated logo introduces Angel's identity.

The capability sections reveal Angel's breadth.

The real screenshots prove what the product looks like.

The authentication experience welcomes the user into that world.

The different sign-in options make entering Angel convenient.

The ability to connect other supported identities gives users flexibility in how they access their companion.

The authenticated workspace remains the centre of the experience.

Everything should feel connected.

Everything should feel intentional.

Everything should feel like Angel.

**Do not build another website and put the Angel logo on it. Build the front entrance to Angel itself.**